auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  The Orders API requires a token since v2. Health endpoints stay anonymous.

  Get a token:
      export accessToken=$(./scripts/get-admin-token.sh)

  ...then paste it into the environment's accessToken secret variable. It is a secret var, so
  it is held in Bruno's local store and never written into a file in this repo.

  That token carries the Orders.Admin.Direct app role, which only an administrator holds. An
  ordinary user has no way to call this API directly — they go through the BFF.
}
